Cross-coupled inverter latch: .nodeset selects the state
VDD vdd 0 1.8
MP1 q qb vdd vdd pch l=1u w=2u
MN1 q qb 0 0 nch l=1u w=1u
MP2 qb q vdd vdd pch l=1u w=2u
MN2 qb q 0 0 nch l=1u w=1u
.nodeset v(q)=1.8 v(qb)=0
.model nch nmos vto=0.5 kp=100u lambda=0.02
.model pch pmos vto=-0.5 kp=40u lambda=0.02
.op
.end
